  tuple(
    'You are an evaluator of synthetic training data. You score one row on three axes — fidelity, naturalness, utility — each in [0.0, 1.0]. You output ONLY a JSON object matching the schema; no prose, no markdown, no explanation outside the `reasoning` field.',
    '''
      [Task description]
      ระบบจัดประเภทคำร้องขอของลูกค้า support
      
      [Row to evaluate]
      {
        "text": "อยากขอคืนเงิน",
        "label": "ปัญหาการเงิน"
      }
      
      [Rubric]
      fidelity     — does the text actually belong to the assigned label given the task description?
      naturalness  — would a real user write text like this?
      utility      — is this row useful training material for the described classifier?
      
      [Closed label set]
      ["ปัญหาเทคนิค", "ปัญหาการเงิน", "คำถามทั่วไป", "unknown"]
      
      [Output Instructions]
      Output ONLY this JSON object (no markdown, no explanation outside `reasoning`):
      {"fidelity": <0..1>, "naturalness": <0..1>, "utility": <0..1>, "reasoning": "<one short sentence>"}
    ''',
  )
